tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344990/extras/22d6abb024530ea0f2345918eba46364.webm?t=1750880156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344990/extras/22d6abb024530ea0f2345918eba46364.mp4?t=1750880156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Look for sick animals and cure them with fruits! Collect flowers, discover lost paintings... Many side quests await you in this feel-good world. Will you find them all?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344990/extras/b8c28fba39ba13bebbeb8b417c4619bf.webp?t=1750880156\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Freely explore a colorful open world. <br></li><li>Learn various skills: climbing, stealth, fighting, bow, bombs, grapple and much more!<br></li><li>Confront or avoid pirates, guards and robots.<br></li><li>Cure sick animals all over the world. <br></li><li>Collect gemstones, paintings and flowers. <br></li><li>Defy giant Guardians during epic battles. <br></li><li>Discover cute and funny characters.<br></li><li>Save the world! Er no, I mean &quot;be a true hero!&quot; Er no, I mean &quot;help your sister.&quot; Well, you have to start somewhere, kid...<br></li><li>Oh, yeah! And ride a cute turtle! But I guess you already got that from the picture.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344990/extras/2307446ee7933a7fb5c6c2ebf52bd004.webp?t=1750880156\" /></div><br>Hi there! I'm Mathias and I've been creating video games since I was a child. I love coding, playing music and drawing. So what's better than creating a video game to do all of this at the same time? I do everything alone because I love every part of it and I'm a curious guy who likes to know how it works! I hope you'll like it :)<br><br>If you want to support me or learn more, don't hesitate to check out my website, where you can find all the links to social media, my dev blog and other stuff. Thank you so much!",
    "short_description": "In a colorful archipelago, play as a young thief studying at the Guild. Investigate kidnappings, steer clear of roaming pirates or fight them. Sail the ocean on a cute turtle and climb every island. Cure sick animals, and find the truth during this feel-good journey. Made by a dreamer solo dev.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe graphics, gameplay, sound design, and music all excel and remain consistently high-quality, making it even more impressive that this is the work of a single developer.\u201d<br />\r\nBibu<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cDang, i'm so so so impressed with the game! I was transported to PS1/PS2 era. It's like Twinsen, Link, Jade, Mega Man Volnutt and Prince of persian decided to create a game together.\u201d<br />\r\nRedDude<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201c11 Years of Hard work by the developer, definitely requires great deal of our appreciation. The game-play is beautify with a unique art style. Has a lot of potential. Definitely recommended for the cozy and chill vibes!!!\u201d<br />\r\nNaruto Kaneki<br />\r\n",
